abstract: >-
  A reproducible command-line workflow for nucleotide sequence dereplication,
  multiple sequence alignment, conservation analysis, and qPCR primer/probe
  design using CD-HIT-EST, MAFFT, and VarVAMP.
keywords:
  - qPCR
  - primer design
  - probe design
  - VarVAMP
  - multiple sequence alignment
  - conservation analysis
  - nucleotide sequences
